# VHS script for the README GIF. Regenerate: `cd examples/agent && vhs demo.tape`
Output attack.gif

Require npm

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1120
Set Height 960
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Sleep 600ms
Type "npm run attack"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 13s
